Verbatim copies from vuejs/vitepress v2.0.0-alpha.20: the originals the
component tests compare vpkit against. Never edit them; re-sync with a
plain copy from a clone checked out at the new tag, then update the tag
above:

  U=../vitepress/src/client/theme-default
  cp $U/styles/vars.css $U/styles/base.css $U/components/VPButton.vue \
    $U/components/VPBadge.vue $U/styles/components/custom-block.css \
    $U/styles/components/vp-doc.css $U/components/VPFeature.vue \
    $U/styles/icons.css $U/styles/utils.css $U/styles/fonts.css \
    $U/styles/components/vp-code-group.css test/upstream/
  cp $U/Layout.vue $U/NotFound.vue test/upstream/components/
  # (test/compare.mjs reads VPSwitch.vue and VPSwitchAppearance.vue from
  # components/ too, as the toggle's originals)
  for c in VPContent VPDoc VPPage VPSkipLink VPBackdrop VPSidebar \
    VPSidebarGroup VPSidebarItem VPLocalNav VPLocalNavOutlineDropdown \
    VPDocAside VPDocAsideOutline VPDocOutlineItem VPDocAsideSponsors \
    VPDocAsideCarbonAds VPNav VPNavBar VPNavBarTitle VPImage VPNavBarSearch \
    VPNavBarSearchButton VPNavBarAskAiButton VPNavMenu VPNavMenuLink \
    VPNavMenuGroup VPFlyout VPMenu VPMenuLink VPMenuGroup VPNavBarExtra \
    VPNavBarHamburger VPNavAppearance VPSwitch VPSwitchAppearance \
    VPNavSocialLinks VPSocialLinks VPSocialLink VPNavTranslations VPNavScreen \
    VPDocFooter VPDocFooterLastUpdated VPFooter VPHome VPHero VPButton \
    VPFeatures VPFeature VPHomeContent VPLocalSearchBox; do
    cp $U/components/$c.vue test/upstream/components/
  done

pages/: vitepress.dev as VitePress v2.0.0-alpha.20 rendered it (each
page's generator meta tag says so), fetched 2026-09-28 by rustpress's
parity refresh (its parity/cache): the markup the layout tests take each
component from. Re-sync by fetching the same pages from a site built with
the new tag.

pages/hydrated/: vitepress.dev in a browser, 2026-10-09, after VitePress's
client ran, at the widths where the navbar's layout changes, and after a
click or hover where a state needs one (the open local nav outline, the open
sidebar, a flyout, the extra menu, the nav screen and its groups): `node scripts/snapshot-vitepress.mjs`, which
fails unless the site's generator is the tag above. pages/hydrated/assets/
holds the stylesheets those pages link, from the same deploy (vpkit's tests
do not read them; vpkit-zola renders the snapshots with them).
